  "panels": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### What this is\nEvery container log on every node goes through **Fluent Bit** to **Loki**, together with the nodes' own logs (kubelet, containerd, kernel) and Kubernetes events. The demo service sends traces through the **OpenTelemetry collector** to **Tempo**. All of it runs in this cluster.\n\n| Dashboard | Use it to |\n|---|---|\n| [2 · Logs explorer](/d/poc-logs) | search any container's logs by namespace, pod, text |\n| [3 · Evicted and disrupted pods](/d/poc-evicted) | see why a pod died and read its last lines |\n| [4 · Node logs](/d/poc-nodes) | kubelet, containerd and kernel: OOM kills, image pulls, probes |\n| [5 · Traces and logs](/d/poc-traces) | follow a request from its trace to its logs and back |\n| [6 · Test scenarios](/d/poc-scenarios) | lines written vs lines received for each test run |\n| [7 · Pipeline health](/d/poc-pipeline) | check that every node is shipping logs |\n\nNumbers below cover the time range at the top right."
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 9
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Log lines",
      "description": "Container log lines received in the time range.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "loki",
        "uid": "loki"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "loki",
            "uid": "loki"
          },
          "expr": "sum(count_over_time({cluster=\"$cluster\", container=~\".+\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "queryType": "instant"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "noValue": "0",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "blue",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value",
        "justifyMode": "center"
